<title>UK: TMCC sets $250 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets $250 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    27.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0785  PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.891    SPREAD	-2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
